ay, so she didn't *just* learn about it, but rather failed to recall it.\n\nStep 4: Conclude the best fit.\nThe mother exhibits confusion and forgetfulness regarding McDonald's, indicating she has some vague impression (from yesterday's meal) but is not sure or cannot recall the name clearly.\n\nAnswer: \boxed{C}
